#: ../../reference/cli.md:1
msgid "参考：命令行入口"
msgstr "Reference: Command-line entry points"

#: ../../reference/cli.md:3
msgid "`magshield-env` 提供三个面向用户的命令。**本站不复制任何 flag 或参数**：运行每个命令的 `--help` 即可获得最新的参数、默认值、可选值和示例，那是唯一真源。"
msgstr "`magshield-env` provides three user-facing commands. **This site does not duplicate any flag or parameter**: run `--help` on each command for the current arguments, defaults, accepted values, and examples; that is the single source of truth."

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "命令"
msgstr "Command"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "`tui`"
msgstr "`tui`"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "打开五步全屏环境构建向导"
msgstr "Open the five-step full-screen environment builder"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "交互画面走 stderr，stdout 未使用"
msgstr "Interactive rendering to stderr; stdout unused"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "`validate`"
msgstr "`validate`"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "校验环境包的哈希、schema、数组与跨文件契约"
msgstr "Validate package hashes, schemas, arrays, and cross-file contracts"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "stdout 一个 JSON 信封"
msgstr "One JSON envelope on stdout"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "`inspect`"
msgstr "`inspect`"

#: ../../reference/cli.md
msgid "读取包元数据与派生维度，不做修改"
msgstr "Read package metadata and derived dimensions without mutation"

#: ../../reference/cli.md:18
msgid "输出契约的语义见[概念：命令输出契约](../concepts/json-output)，脚本消费示例见[操作指南](../how-to/use-json-output)。"
msgstr "Output-contract semantics: [Concept: command output contract](../concepts/json-output); script examples: [How-to](../how-to/use-json-output)."
